WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
You usually study so hard and still have to work part-time

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,680
I won't delay your business, right?

3
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:07,760
I usually do odd jobs when I have nothing to do

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,360
Also worked as a housekeeper and cleaner

5
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:11,920
Cleaning up the house for her is nothing

6
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:14,080
You gave me such a good place to live

7
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:17,680
Do I always have to do something for you to feel at ease?

8
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:18,800
After being admitted to university

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,440
My family didn't give me a penny

10
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,880
Except for being born when the heroine’s plot requires it.

11
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,320
I work the rest of the time

12
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,880
Accumulated a lot of social experience

13
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:28,080
This is also thanks to the setting given to me by the author

14
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,240
If Xiao Ke can really persuade Xu Chen

15
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,760
Let her accept the existence of a cleaning nanny again

16
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:35,460
I can also feel more at ease

17
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,660
Then I'll make some kimchi in the next two days.

18
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,860
You bring it to her for me on Sunday

19
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:42,740
If she can slowly accept America's door-to-door cleaning

20
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:46,100
Grandma will waive your monthly rent for you.

21
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,380
OK Grandma Lin

22
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,100
I won't let you down

23
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,540
With this reason

24
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:53,030
can continue to approach Jiang Xucheng

25
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:55,580
The strategy will no longer be so passive.

26
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,020
But for now

27
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,700
Lu Ling is the main target
